{"id":"152f2d2925995a62","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative.md","title":"唯一函数定义不增加旧语言后果","display":"thm-unique-function-definition-conservative — 唯一函数定义不增加旧语言后果","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative","aliases":["72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative"],"display":"thm-unique-function-definition-conservative — 唯一函数定义不增加旧语言后果","depends_on":["[[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II Theorem1.2.7.3, print88–89/PDF100–101; basic definitional-conservativity case","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-unique-function-definition-conservative — 唯一函数定义不增加旧语言后果"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"359d2fc3caebbb0d\" href=\"?note=359d2fc3caebbb0d\" title=\"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension\">72-df-unique-function-definition-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II Theorem1.2.7.3, print88–89/PDF100–101; basic definitional-conservativity case"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>参数与理论全性唯一性条件取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"359d2fc3caebbb0d\" href=\"?note=359d2fc3caebbb0d\" title=\"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension\">72-df-unique-function-definition-extension</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。两个可证性使用各自语言的完整含等号一阶演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一 T 模型对每个输入元组由已证明的存在唯一性得到唯一输出，因而唯一扩张为定义公理的模型。若扩充证明 A，则全部 T 模型都满足 A，一阶完备性给旧演算证明；另一方向保留原有限证明即可。这是一般函数定义扩充的模型论证明。没有在这里重证一般一阶完备性，也没有据此容许任意未知总性的函数定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension","status":"resolved","id":"359d2fc3caebbb0d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension","status":"resolved","id":"359d2fc3caebbb0d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"参数与理论全性唯一性条件取 [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]]；$A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)$。两个可证性使用各自语言的完整含等号一阶演算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"T[f:\\rho]\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}A\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}A.","display":true}],"bytes":1617,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-eliminatio